# Database documentation sync

When a change under `supabase/` (or an equivalent dashboard SQL change reflected in this repo) affects:

- tables / columns / checks / triggers
- RLS policies
- security-definer RPCs
- Edge Functions
- cron jobs (e.g. `check_alert_escalations`)

update **`docs/DATABASE.md`** and **`docs/API.md`** in the **same change**.

- Keep the Mermaid ERD and table-by-table sections accurate.
- Note that the authoritative schema is Supabase project `pvafygrloelptlmnhfog`; the ERD is maintained by hand.
- Do not invent columns — source from migrations, client usage, or confirmed dashboard schema.
